<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NationsBank downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NationsBank downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it lowered its rating on NationsBank Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Firm cited Boatmen's Bancshares Inc merger pact for rating change.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
